From: LearnOS integration verification
Subject: OIDC: allow the RP app origin in CSP form-action

FloatCTF currently derives form-action only from redirect_uri. Providers behind
an intermediary (Supabase Auth) do a second redirect to the application, which
Chrome blocks because the final origin is not allowlisted.

